  "_about": "The watchlist for the scan. EVERYTHING in this file is MOCKED: the holdings, the open orders and both vendor records. The announcements the scan finds are real and retrieved by Exa. Holdings and orders never leave this laptop; only the issuer name and identifier go into a search. Every text is fixed (no date is computed from today) so request bodies stay identical and saved runs keep matching.",

  "scan_start_published": "2026-08-03T00:00:00Z",
  "scan_window_note": "Announcements published on or after 2026-08-03 (about 60 days before 2026-10-02).",

